2026-09-25T03:51:59.4199814Z [36;1m# Desktop-update hand-off integration tests spawn the real[0m
2026-09-25T03:51:59.4200368Z [36;1m# windows.ps1; deselect them unless the PR touched that surface[0m
2026-09-25T03:51:59.4200882Z [36;1m# (see the workflow_call input). ``--ignore-glob`` keeps the file[0m
2026-09-25T03:51:59.4201774Z [36;1m# list above intact, so a renamed test file still trips the[0m
