2026-09-25T03:51:59.4202844Z [36;1m# (bash 3.2 on the macOS runner: an empty array under ``set -u`` is[0m
2026-09-25T03:51:59.4203362Z [36;1m# an unbound-variable error, hence the ``${arr[@]+...}`` idiom.)[0m
